# Intentionally empty. Grafana logs an error at startup for every provisioning
# directory it cannot open, and those two lines then show up in the "Warnings and
# errors" panel on every restart. A panel with permanent benign errors in it is a
# panel people stop reading, so the directory exists to keep it quiet.
#
# Alerting is deliberately not provisioned here: alert rules live in
# deploy/prometheus/alerts.yml and are routed by Alertmanager, which keeps them
# checkable by promtool in CI.
